' ============================================
' LEGEND (Professional Documentation)
' ============================================
legend bottom
  **Architecture Pattern:** Clean Architecture + Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters)
  
  **Tech Stack:**
  • Frontend: Next.js 14 + React 19 + TypeScript + TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui
  • Backend: Express 4 + Node.js 20 + TypeScript 5
  • Database: PostgreSQL 15 (Supabase Cloud + RLS)
  • AI: Google Gemini 2.0 Flash
  • Email: Gmail SMTP/IMAP (OAuth2)
  
  **Component Metrics:**
  • 11 Frontend Pages (Next.js App Router)
  • 6 Custom Hooks (React business logic)
  • 13 Backend REST Routes
  • 9 Middleware Components (Security + Error pipeline)
  • 2 Controllers (AgentController, DashboardController)
  • 7 Domain Services (AI, Email, Inbox, PDF, Scraper, Cron, UserContext)
  • 16 Database Tables (normalized schema)
  
  **Middleware Pipeline Flow:**
  1️⃣ Helmet → Adds 13 security headers (XSS, Clickjacking protection)
  2️⃣ CORS → Controls cross-origin access (localhost:3000 ↔ :3001)
  3️⃣ Request Logger → Logs all requests with correlation ID
  4️⃣ Rate Limiter → DDoS protection (100 req/15min per IP)
  5️⃣ Auth (JWT) → Verifies JWT tokens from Supabase
  6️⃣ Validation (Zod) → Schema validation for request body/params
  7️⃣ Upload (Multer) → Handles file uploads (PDFs, attachments)
  8️⃣ asyncHandler → Wraps async functions, forwards errors to #9
  9️⃣ Error Handler → Global error catcher, returns formatted JSON
  
  **Design Patterns:**
  • Repository Pattern: BaseService<T> (1/7 services)
  • Mediator Pattern: AgentOrchestrator
  • Singleton: Logger, Config, Cache
  • Dependency Injection: Constructor-based
  • SOLID Principles: Partially applied (see notes)
  
  **Line Types:**
  ——— Blue (#1976D2): Frontend internal flow (React components)
  ——— Orange Bold (#FF6F00): Cross-boundary calls (Frontend→Backend, External→Services)
  ——— Green Bold (#43A047): Database access + Clean Architecture (Controllers, Extends)
  ——— Yellow (#FBC02D): Middleware pipeline (sequential processing)
  ——— Purple (#7B1FA2): Application layer routing (Routes, Orchestration)
  ——— Gray (#616161): Infrastructure dependencies (Logger, Config, Cache)
  - - - - Red Dashed (#D32F2F): Tech debt (bypasses controller layer)
  ····· Hidden: Layout control (no visual)
  
  **⚠️ Architectural Debt:**
  • 11/13 routes skip controllers (~3,736 lines inline handlers)
  • Priority refactoring: EmailController (280 lines), PDFController (597 lines)
  • 6/7 services don't use Repository Pattern (specialized patterns preferred)
  
  **Senior-Level Visualization Techniques:**
  ✓ Ortho linetype (clean 90° angles)
  ✓ Left-to-right flow (natural reading)
  ✓ Color-coded tech debt (red dashed lines)
  ✓ Hidden lines for layout control (no visual clutter)
  ✓ Logical grouping by domain
  ✓ Complete component visibility (not abstracted away)
  ✓ Transparent about architectural problems
  
  **Purpose:** Complete technical reference + presentation-ready
  **Detail Level:** Full (all components, all connections)
  **Audience:** Technical teams, architects, senior developers
  
